s\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">step</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">:</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep\">IterStep</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterM\">IterM</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Exists\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">it</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterM.IsPlausibleStep\">IsPlausibleStep</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep\">IterStep</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterM\">IterM</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">step</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Every iterator with state `α` in monad `m` has exactly one plausible step.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.LawfulDeterministicIterator.isPlausibleStep_eq_eq","kind":"theorem","line":1019,"name":"Std.LawfulDeterministicIterator.isPlausibleStep_eq_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.lean#L1019-L1019"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.LawfulDeterministicIterator.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">LawfulDeterministicIterator</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">∀ {<span class=\"fn\">β </span><span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"