</span>.<span class=\"name\">IterStep</span>.<span class=\"name\">successor</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> w}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep\">IterStep</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the succeeding iterator stored in an iterator step or `none` if the step is `.done`\nand the iterator has finished.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep.successor","kind":"def","line":243,"name":"Std.IterStep.successor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.lean#L243-L251"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep.done\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">IterStep</span>.<span class=\"name\">done</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> u_1}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> u_2}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.IterStep\">Ite